# Enrollment Status Dashboard
Output docs/gifs/19-enrollment-dashboard.mp4
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# Enrollment Dashboard — All ACME and EST Endpoints"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "./lab enrollment-status"
Enter
Sleep 6s
